 rows=\"1\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 30시간 기준(1인 최대 27만원)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 6시간 미만일 경우, 봉사인증서 및 혜택, 지원금 수령 불가</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 오프라인 사전교육 참여할 경우, 봉사시간 2시간 인정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 30시간 초과하여 봉사한 참여자는 30시간에 대한 지원금을 지급하되, 초과한 시간까지 봉사 인증서 발급 가능 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #fb861f 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 23.33pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">봉사장소</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #fb861f 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 23.33pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 멘티 학교 및 참여 대학 시설 등 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #fb861f 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 40.13pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">봉사내용</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #fb861f 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 40.13pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 학습지도(예체능 과목 지도 포함)·상담·토론 등의 멘토링</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 특별활동(영화관람·박물관견학 등 체험학습) 포함</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 474.34pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffe1e1; HEIGHT: 21.48pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 신청 대상</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">○</span> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">초·중·고등학교 등 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">정부인증 사회봉사기관</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">에서 초·중·고등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학교 학생을 대상으로 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">지식봉사(교육기부) 활동 예정인</span></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 대학 재학생 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">재단에서 신규매칭이 불가능하므로, 멘티기관과 매칭이 완료된 학생만 신청 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ 대학원생<strong><font size=\"3\">·</font></strong>휴학생 가능하며, 별도 성적기준 없음 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">※</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 정부인증 사회봉사기관 여부는 보건복지부(www.vms.or.kr), 행정안전부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.1365.go.kr) 등 참조, 정부인증기관이 아닌 경우 모든 혜택이 지원되지 않음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 474.34pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffe1e1; HEIGHT: 21.48pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 신청 기간 및 방법</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Po